 her older sister. One day, she is invited to perform at a music festival as a session musician by a famous enka singer named Dankichi. At the same time, Shinnosuke returns to Aoi and Akane's town after a long time away. Then, Shinno mysteriously appears, and Aoi falls in love for the first time.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":93,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Band","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rural","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Orphan","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":75,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Unrequited Love","rank":30,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Rock Music","rank":26,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Her Blue Sky","english":"Her Blue Sky","native":"空の青さを知る人よ","romaji":"Sora no Aosa wo Shiru Hito yo","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"知晓天空之蓝的人啊"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"知道天空有多蓝的人啊"}]},"trailer":{"id":"YGzSrGnIm5M","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YGzSrGnIm5M/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}